<title>FRANCE: Havas,Gle des Eaux to bid on SFP - sources.</title>
<headline>Havas,Gle des Eaux to bid on SFP - sources.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1996-10-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>Havas and Compagnie Generale des Eaux will submit an offer for audiovisual production firm SFP by Wednesday, sources close to the SFP privatisation process said on Monday.</p>
<p>&quot;The offer is no longer just a possibility, it will be made early in the week, Tuesday or Wednesday at the latest,&quot; said one of the sources.</p>
<p>A Havas spokesman limited himself to saying &quot;the SFP dossier is still in the works&quot;. Generale des Eaux declined to comment.</p>
<p>The employee representatives committee at SFP is currently hearing suitors on three main pojnts -- their industrial plan, operating outlook and plans for thw workforce.</p>
<p>-- Paris Newsroom +33 1 4221 5452</p>
